; H2 route-R2 sandbox profile for job H2-A-01. PROPOSED, [AGENT]; human approval PENDING; authorizes nothing.
; The custom-profile language of sandbox-exec is not documented in any installed source. What network*, file-write*,
; subpath, literal and param do here is fixture-observed only, on one OS build (docs/SOURCES.md [56]).
; The R2 driver passes H2_PAYLOAD_DIR and H2_SCRATCH_DIR with -D as canonical attempt paths. Without them the
; profile was observed to be rejected before the command started.
(version 1)
(allow default)
(deny network*)
(deny file-write*)
(allow file-write*
    (subpath (param "H2_PAYLOAD_DIR"))
    (subpath (param "H2_SCRATCH_DIR"))
    ; /dev/null discards what is written. Refusing it made subprocess.DEVNULL fail in the fixture ([56]).
    (literal "/dev/null"))
